Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sixth Episode\NThe Little Goblin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,On an island in the South,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.70,0:01:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,in the Southern sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.82,0:02:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,there is a little elf\Nwho plays and wants to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,On that island in the South,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.58,0:02:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,in the blue Southern sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.86,0:02:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,there is a cheeky elf\Nwho knows how to use his magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.62,0:02:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's not very pretty,\Nthis is my boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.06,0:02:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,so please\Ndon't laugh at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.06,0:02:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's not ugly! It's just funny!\N- I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.70,0:02:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like a sailor!\NBut what do I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.78,0:02:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I see something..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.34,0:02:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is this?\NA seashell...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.90,0:02:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.94,0:02:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- I hear a voice...\N- Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.82,0:02:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.74,0:02:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:03:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavens, what a surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he? Where is he? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.34,0:03:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's costing me dearly to follow\NPrince Sapphire on his vacation!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.62,0:03:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything about it at all,\Ndamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an order\Nfrom Grand Duke Duralumin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Here comes that little angel!\N- There is an elf inside here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,An elf in a seashell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.02,0:03:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! They had locked me\Nin here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.06,0:03:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He says he comes\Nfrom a distant southern island..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...and that he was\Ndragged all the way here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.54,0:03:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,always locked inside his shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your father's name,\Nlittle elf?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.34,0:03:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Genie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.18,0:03:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say "Genie"? But isn't he\Nthe spirit of the magic lamp,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.78,0:03:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,the one from the fairy tales\Nof "One Thousand and One Nights"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.94,0:03:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he used to be in the lamp,\Nbut now he is old...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.42,0:04:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...and prefers to live on\Nan island in the South Seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.66,0:04:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the genie of the magic\Nlamp! Ah, interesting news!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.94,0:04:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that the magic\Nlamp granted every wish...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.34,0:04:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- Shut up!\N- My father granted wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.50,0:04:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...of whoever possessed the magic\Nlamp, but he stopped doing so!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.70,0:04:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you saved me, I will\Nhave your wishes granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.94,0:04:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,In return, I ask you only one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.58,0:04:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If I get you what you want do\Nyou promise to take me back home?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I want to say,\Non the South Seas island!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My father hasn't seen me in a long\Ntime and he must be worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.54,0:04:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's..! Do you believe it, Tink?\N- I do! And you, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he told\Na pack of lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.06,0:04:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- I think he's a liar!\N- NO! What I told you is true..
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.62,0:04:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I'll prove it to you\Nif you take me home!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.18,0:04:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't bring myself to believe\Nhis words!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.02,0:04:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I feel sorry for that poor guy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.94,0:04:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's none of my business!\NYou keep him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.30,0:05:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The genie of the magic lamp\Ngrants every wish,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,so if I can catch\Nthat pixie..!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.90,0:05:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Baron Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Your Highness! I was just passing by!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.22,0:05:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar! That will teach you to lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.90,0:05:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was on my way\Nto your castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.94,0:05:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then hurry on over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.90,0:05:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Of course, Your Highness!\N- Wait for me, I'm coming with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This Sapphire\Nis really a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't like Sapphire.\NHe was truly heartless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.78,0:05:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, little elf
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.26,0:05:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take you to your home,\Non that island in the South Seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.58,0:05:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, little one! Don't go\Nout to sea! Give me that elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.90,0:05:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't even think of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.30,0:06:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So much the worse for you! Now I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.22,0:06:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!\NHow come you came back?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.62,0:06:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous for little ones\Nto play with boats, and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, come back to shore!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, do you hear me? Come back, I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you didn't believe\Nhis words.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.10,0:06:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Don't be foolish! You won't\Nmanage to reach the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.74,0:06:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How stubborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.90,0:06:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Tink!\NIn the sea there are sharks
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...that eat men and\Nwhales and other monstrous animals!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.74,0:06:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.58,0:06:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to leave me alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Tink,\NI would like to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.94,0:06:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I will take you there! For now you can\Nstay in my hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink is really hospitable!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.66,0:06:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go back!\NLet me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.06,0:07:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Tink! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.50,0:07:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.26,0:07:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to catch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Tink!\NI'll try to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.66,0:07:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.14,0:07:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, there are so many\Nof them! It's a whole pack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.30,0:08:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray, I'm saved!\NMaybe I made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.06,0:08:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if this is the island of\Nthe South Seas..! Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.58,0:08:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, but that\Nlooks like a whale to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.34,0:08:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, that's not\Nan island! It's a whale!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.78,0:08:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A whale?! I thought it\Nwas a Southern island!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.18,0:08:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.54,0:08:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Here! Take the anchor, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.34,0:08:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.46,0:08:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go down, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.42,0:09:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late!\NNow it's going too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I should run for it, but I\Ncan't abandon Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.82,0:09:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,An island!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.62,0:09:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to crash into the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't even stop\Non dry land!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.34,0:09:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to stop it!\NI've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.90,0:09:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's down there? A ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.62,0:09:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.26,0:10:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What a crash!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.86,0:10:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not a dinosaur,\Nit's a rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.30,0:10:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help, Sapphire!\NI can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.30,0:10:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hold onto my hand!\N- I can't reach!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.82,0:10:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can touch the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.34,0:10:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How come? I can touch too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What could it be, Sapphire?\NCan you explain this mystery?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Look!\N- What do you think it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.74,0:11:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a flying manta ray, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight! Here's another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.50,0:11:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could I be? I'm lost\Nin the middle of the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.02,0:12:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,An island!\NIt's the South Seas island!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.14,0:12:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray, I've arrived!\NIt's the island! Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.74,0:12:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But where is Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.54,0:12:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it! I'll light a fire\Nto let her know where I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.14,0:12:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope she sees the smoke
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.90,0:12:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? Ah, it's you\Nwho spoke! What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let me go!\N- A dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.70,0:12:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, is that so? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.02,0:12:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- So many monsters!\N- What's happening? Why did you call?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.34,0:12:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's teach them a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.78,0:12:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Better run for it!\NHow strange..!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.78,0:12:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,On this island, trees and\Nanimals are smaller than normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.50,0:12:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe this\Nis the elf's island!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.62,0:12:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here, see if you\Nrecognize the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.82,0:12:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared, Tink! I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.74,0:12:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not my island!\NThis is a very strange place!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.02,0:12:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Get off our island!\N- Get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.06,0:13:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see how I chased him away?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.10,0:13:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This bird\Nis as small as a fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.42,0:13:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!\NA swarm of them is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.46,0:13:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, they don't intend\Nto stop! Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.02,0:13:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I definitely want to leave\Nthis place! But how do I do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.58,0:13:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the solution!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This small-scale whirlwind\Nwill carry me away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.74,0:13:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful! It feels\Nlike I'm on a carousel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.10,0:13:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I see a wisp of smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.06,0:13:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe there's someone on\Nthis island! Maybe Tink is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.46,0:13:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, where are you? Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look...! They look like\Nthe footprints of Tink's shoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, it's me: Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.06,0:14:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Tink?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.06,0:14:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Strange! His footprints\Nend on this rocky ledge!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.78,0:14:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.30,0:14:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I? Where have we\Nended up? A giant footprint!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But then... There are giants!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.78,0:14:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Giants?!\N- Don't be afraid, little elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.46,0:14:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I will protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps, from the island\Nof dwarfs, that whirlwind...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.06,0:14:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...has brought us to the island\Nof giants. You will stay in a shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.34,0:14:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Everything is so huge!\N- Let me out, I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.86,0:14:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, stay quiet or\Nthe giants will hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.02,0:14:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, goodness! What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Mrs. Frog, don't eat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.02,0:15:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! It's chasing me! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.26,0:15:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I am indigestible, Mrs. Frog!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.10,0:15:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where can I hide? Oh, there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.30,0:15:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't shake too much, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.02,0:15:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- I want to get out!\N- Quiet, or the giant will hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.82,0:15:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We must leave immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.70,0:16:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,More frogs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.50,0:16:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, little boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.86,0:16:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, they don't seem bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the chief\Nand I welcome you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, I am the chief!\N- Don't listen to him! I'm in charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.90,0:16:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I gather that you want\Nsomething from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.74,0:16:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Please! Help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.06,0:16:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I help you if I don't\Nknow the danger that threatens you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That man wants to eat us!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.74,0:16:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.54,0:17:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens! These\Nfrogs are poisonous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.02,0:17:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I see Tink's footprints.\NHe must be on this island!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.42,0:17:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink! It's me! It's Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.94,0:17:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! The\Ngiant has taken her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see... Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.02,0:17:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so huge! I will never manage\Nto defeat him by normal means!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.06,0:17:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.70,0:17:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go any further!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.78,0:18:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, get out of there\Nor the giant will kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.74,0:18:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! He's going to\Nmake the mountain collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.10,0:18:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is what I'll do! I must\Ngo to the frogs I met earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.94,0:18:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Only they can help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.26,0:18:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.10,0:18:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I will help you against the giant if\Nyou tell me where you got the poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.02,0:18:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We get it from\Nthe root of a plant!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.66,0:18:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any more of those roots?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.14,0:18:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, of course!\N- Absolutely!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.90,0:18:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now listen to me carefully!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.82,0:18:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You will put some poison in\Nyour mouth and spit it at the giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.06,0:18:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- In our mouths?\N- Of course! You will spit it at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, we understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.26,0:18:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He managed\Nto widen the crack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.34,0:19:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die in a place\Nlike this! I must do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.86,0:19:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Green and sparkling,\Nwe are the frogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.34,0:19:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are, leaping,\Nall together we arrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.78,0:19:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop now!\NWe're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.42,0:19:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I will at least try\Nto cut off his finger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.70,0:19:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to spit the poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Spit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.34,0:19:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the giant\Nleaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.46,0:20:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I see! That's Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.54,0:20:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.58,0:20:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so glad\Nthat you are safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.54,0:20:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank the frogs! They were the\Nones who chased the giant away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.02,0:20:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, by now I had lost\Nall hope of finding you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.42,0:20:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm deeply moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! The giant is washing himself,\Nso he can wash off the poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.18,0:20:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he intends to\Nclimb all the way up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.02,0:20:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I will cut the ivy, to stop\Nhim from climbing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.26,0:20:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let me out! It's important!\N- We are still in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We could escape quickly\Nand you're fine where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.62,0:21:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm missing one, Sapphire! Only one!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.02,0:21:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get out!\NI made it, finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.06,0:21:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my island\Nand that is my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.06,0:21:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Then how do you explain\Nthat he has a horn and you don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.90,0:21:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He has it because we grow a horn\Nwhen we get angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.42,0:21:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You grew one too!\NThen you are his son!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.58,0:21:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't hurt him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.98,0:21:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Stop!\NThat giant is my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.94,0:21:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.02,0:21:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad! Dad! It's me!\NI'm your son!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.18,0:21:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Elf! Is it really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.42,0:21:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, it's me!\N- My dear son!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.34,0:21:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll catch you! There!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.86,0:21:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- My little elf!\N- Dear dad, I missed you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.54,0:21:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't wait to see you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.02,0:21:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The last section is breaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.50,0:22:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.86,0:22:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to see you again
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.22,0:22:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too, dad!\NThese two guys are my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.14,0:22:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They are so kind!\NThey brought me back here to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.78,0:22:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so grateful to you! I was so worried\Nand anxious about my little one!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.18,0:22:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So he is the genie\Nof the magic lamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.02,0:22:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise me you will never go\Nto the beach to play alone again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.30,0:22:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise, Dad:\NI won't ever leave you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.94,0:22:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you were so worried\Nabout me all this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.46,0:22:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of gratitude,\NI will grant your wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.74,0:22:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you,\Nthere is no need to trouble yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.34,0:22:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry about the misunderstanding.\N- I am too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.18,0:22:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'd like to return\Nyour kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.90,0:23:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then could you make it so\Nthat Sapphire can be happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.86,0:23:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I prefer to earn it\Non my own, happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.62,0:23:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad could free you\Nfrom all your enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.30,0:23:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I will manage to get rid of them\Nwith my own strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.94,0:23:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad told me that a certain\NNylon chased you all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.74,0:23:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have wanted to set a trap for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.10,0:23:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, he certainly looked like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.14,0:23:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry!\NSince he seemed bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.38,0:23:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I transformed him with\Nmagic into a seagull!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.26,0:23:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Into a seagull?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.58,0:23:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.62,0:23:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodbye, Genie!\N- Restore Nylon to his true form!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.30,0:23:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I really think this has\Nbeen a good lesson for him!
